<title>SPAIN: Spanish Treasury fixes new 3-yr coupon at 6.75 pct.</title>
<headline>Spanish Treasury fixes new 3-yr coupon at 6.75 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spain's Treasury said on Thursday that it had set a new 6.75 percent coupon for its three-year note, which will be issued on November 15 with a maturity date on April 15, 2000.</p>
<p>The previous three-year note coupon was 7.80 percent.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom + 34 1 585 2151</p>
</text>
